{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painkiller is a reimagining of the classic franchise, featuring co-op play for up to three players and full offline support. Battle hordes of demons and titanic terrors across richly detailed gothic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in Purgatory, you are sentenced for your transgressions against Heaven. But the Voice of the Creator gives you a chance to redeem yourself. As one of the Champions, you are to stop the fallen angel Azazel who is about to unleash his demonic armies onto Earth. You will face hordes of enemies, demons with unique powers and three monstrous children of Azazel - the Nephilim.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in your mission and earn your salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purgatory Is Your Playground - </strong>Jump, dash, and hook across vast biomes while fighting enemies with a host of new and classic Painkiller weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grotesque Terrors Await </strong>- Challenge a variety of enemies ranging from hordes of smaller demons to titanic terrors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash The Pain</strong> - Utilize tarot cards to enhance your abilities and combine them with other players to obliterate your foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Character Wisely</strong> - Play as one of four distinctive characters - Ink, Void, Sol and Roch - and take advantage of their unique perks to boost your energy, health, power and damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300120?t=1759157236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300120?t=1759157236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/2d3fd1096153816c18349faff897271e93eb1840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759157236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/2d3fd1096153816c18349faff897271e93eb1840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759157236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Lots of fast-paced action, violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/18b32856da64a28a9a14b9d16e6d6168.avif?t=1759157236\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order Now And Lock and Load With The Iron Crusade Skins Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Medieval Skins For Each Character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 Unique Weapon Skins for the Stakegun, SMG, Shotgun, Rocket launcher, Handcanon and Electrodriver</p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/2ca8aaecb445d45f6b44a539abe63790.avif?t=1759157236\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash Chaos with the Deluxe Edition: Raise hell in style with exclusive skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painkiller Deluxe Edition Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Base Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Season Pass: Weapon and Character Skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the horrors of Purgatory with the Painkiller Season Pass. Across three releases, Night Watch, Metal as Hell and Demon Awakening, you\u2019ll gain access to 12 character outfits and 18 weapon skins. The chaos begins at launch with Night Watch. Pain is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painkiller is a reimagining of the classic franchise, featuring co-op play for up to three players and full offline support. Battle hordes of demons and titanic terrors across richly detailed gothic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in Purgatory, you are sentenced for your transgressions against Heaven. But the Voice of the Creator gives you a chance to redeem yourself. As one of the Champions, you are to stop the fallen angel Azazel who is about to unleash his demonic armies onto Earth. You will face hordes of enemies, demons with unique powers and three monstrous children of Azazel - the Nephilim.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in your mission and earn your salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purgatory Is Your Playground - </strong>Jump, dash, and hook across vast biomes while fighting enemies with a host of new and classic Painkiller weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/df373ec1e406517c06c12d3487aae927.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grotesque Terrors Await </strong>- Challenge a variety of enemies ranging from hordes of smaller demons to titanic terrors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/acac476e5f8ea30f630b275f94168da9.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash The Pain</strong> - Utilize tarot cards to enhance your abilities and combine them with other players to obliterate your foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/82df8da5fc8ccafc6f09e6e5de49aa60.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Character Wisely</strong> - Play as one of four distinctive characters - Ink, Void, Sol and Roch - and take advantage of their unique perks to boost your energy, health, power and damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.poster.avif?t=1759157236\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.webm?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/extras/7317745a03c3ce6c441f9e5579ea3d93.mp4?t=1759157236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Anshar Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300120/fa89a77d18796ccbc571f178b67f348b671b529d/header.jpg?t=1759157236","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Painkiller \u00a9 2025 Saber Interactive Inc. and Anshar Studios S.A. Developed by Saber Interactive Inc. and Anshar Studios S.A. Published by Saber Interactive Inc. and 3D Realms Entertainment ApS. Saber Interactive\u2122, and the Saber Interactive logo are trademarks of Saber Interactive Inc. 3D Realms\u2122 and the 3D Realms logo are trademarks of 3D Realms Entertainment ApS. All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners.<br />\r\nPainkiller uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or r